--TEST--
`is static` inside an anonymous function is `E0834`, because its frame holds no called class, and a `static` deeper than the whole tested type is `E1021` in a class that is not `final` (`rule:statements/static-is-a-member-modifier`)
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Model {
    public function check(Model $o): void {
        callable $f = fn(): bool => $o is static;
        $f();
    }

    public static function all(array<Model> $xs): bool {
        return $xs is array<static>;
    }
}

class Order extends Model {}
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0834]: `is static` names no class inside an anonymous function
%A
4 |         callable $f = fn(): bool => $o is static;
%A
error[E1021]: `static` can only be the whole tested type, as in `is static` or `is ?static`
%A
9 |         return $xs is array<static>;
%A
error: aborting due to 2 errors
%A
